Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were just saying, great apartment man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正在夸你的公寓  老兄
