Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay, I'll go out first, all right? - Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好了  我先出去  好吗  -好
