Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:18.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他告诉沙约翰·夏皮罗  那个女孩不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:21.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, he told Johnny that he thinks he's falling in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上  他告诉强尼  他觉得自己爱上她了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - I tell you, I've never seen him this happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的  -告诉你  我没见他这么快乐过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Jack...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰克  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you ever think about trading me in for a younger model?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有想过  拿我去换个年轻小妞儿  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:31.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:31.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With you, it's like I've got two 25-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不就等于两个二五佳人  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Jack, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰克  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天可是我生日
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we drop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说了  好吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not interested in the guy's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对那家伙的公寓没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. I saw the way you were checking out his moldings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别装了  我看到你看他房子装饰的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I want another apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么要另一间公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've already got an apartment that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经有个我爱的公寓了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wouldn't kill you to say it once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偶尔这样说说又不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. You want the truth? I'm thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  想听实话吗  我的确在考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么  -抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:19.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm 28 years old, I've never lived alone, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:19.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今年28了  从没自己住过  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I'm finally at a place where I've got enough money 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我终于赚到足够的钱  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that I don't need a roommate anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以让我不再需要室友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need a roommate either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不需要室友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can afford to live here by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自己住这里我也负担得起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I may have to bring in somebody once a week to lick the silverware.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我或许一个礼拜得请一次人来舔我的餐具
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What're you gettin' so bent out of shape for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你火气怎么那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not like we agreed to live together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们又没说要永远住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not Bert and Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们又不是连体婴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:45.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:45.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If this is the way you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你这样觉得  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then maybe you should take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那或许你应该搬去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:53.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's how I feel. - Then maybe you should take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:53.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是那样觉得  -那或许你应该搬去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那或许我会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:55.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Fine with me! - Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:55.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没意见  -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:58.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you'll be able to spend more quality time with your real friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:58.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就有多点时间跟你真正的朋友在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the spoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的汤匙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whose drink can I freshen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁还要加点饮料  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Almost time for cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快要切蛋糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡  你还好吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You remember that video I found of Mom and Dad? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-记得我发现爸妈的那卷录影带吗  -记得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I just caught the live show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚看了现场秀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, there. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨  -怎样  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I just heard something nice about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么  我刚听到你的好话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Richard. Richard. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}理查德  理查德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Your son isn't seeing anyone is he? - Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你儿子现在没女友吧  -据我所知  没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking, why doesn't he give Monica a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是在想  他何不打个电话给摩妮卡  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这主意不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:06.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, I'm already seeing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:06.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上  我已经有男友了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She never tells us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这孩子什么事都不讲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:16.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, did you know Monica's seeing someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:16.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  你知道摩妮卡有男友了吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, there are so many people in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈  我周遭有好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some of them are seeing people and some of them aren't. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人有男友  有些人没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够清楚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who's the mystery man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个神秘男子是谁  
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A real doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真正的医生  
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:36.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, a doctor of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:36.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  他是兽医
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course he's a real doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他当然是真的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还很英俊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's sweet, and I know you'd like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也很体贴  我知道你会喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:55.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:55.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈  没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  朱迪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:02.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you come in here for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:02.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能过来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Found it! - I'll take that, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-找到了  -交给我  爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It seems your daughter and Richard are something of an item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你女儿跟理查德看来似乎是一对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's impossible. He's got a twinkie in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不可能  他在城里有个笨丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, I'm the twinkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸  我就是那个笨丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're the twinkie? - She's not a twinkie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你就是那个笨丫头  -她不是个笨丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alright,look you guys, this is the best relationship I've been in. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  听着  各位  这是我最棒的一段感情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please! A relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  感情  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, a relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  感情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For your information, I'm crazy about this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们请听好  我爱死这个男人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗  -真的  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I supposed to stand here and listen to this on my birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我生日还要站在这里  听你说这些鬼话吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, dad this is a good thing for me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸  这对我而言是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ya know, and you even said yourself, you've never seen Richard happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你自己也说  你没见理查德那么快乐过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么时候说的  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Upstairs in the bathroom, right before you felt up Mom!
